<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="3" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="End User Layer (EUL) - Version" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="False" Title="&amp;Sheet&#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL)&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;This Workbook examines the &apos;EUL&apos; definition and consists of the following Worksheets;&#x000d;&#x000a;     Version - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Business Areas &amp; Folders - Folders, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Folders &amp; Items - Items, by Folder by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Joins - Joins defined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Conditions - Conditions defined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Hierarchies - Hierarchies defined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Item Classes - List of Values defined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Security - Access to Business Areas, by Users/Roles.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Privileges - Access Privileges, by Users/Roles.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Summary Mappings - Mapping of Folders to Summaries, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Workbook Management - Who can access and run who&apos;s Workbooks.&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;You can use these Workbooks to help document and administer your EUL." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="777" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=1 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;This Workbook examines the &apos;EUL&apos; definition and consists of the following Worksheets&lt;/u&gt;;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Version&lt;/b&gt; - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Business Areas &amp; Folders&lt;/b&gt; - Folders, by Business Area.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Folders &amp; Items&lt;/b&gt; - Items, by Folder by Business Area.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Joins&lt;/b&gt; - Joins defined, by Business Area.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Conditions&lt;/b&gt; - Conditions defined, by Business Area.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Hierarchies&lt;/b&gt; - Hierarchies defined, by Business Area.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Item Classes &lt;/b&gt;- List of Values defined, by Business Area.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Security &lt;/b&gt;- Access to Business Areas, by Users/Roles.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Privileges&lt;/b&gt; - Access Privileges, by Users/Roles.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Summary Mappings&lt;/b&gt; - Mapping of Folders to Summaries, by Business Area.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;    &lt;b&gt; Workbook Management&lt;/b&gt; - Who can access and run who&apos;s Workbooks.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;System&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;You can use these Workbooks to help document and administer your EUL.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f2\fswiss\fprq2 System;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qc\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs16 &amp;Sheet&#x000d;&#x000a;\par &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\ulnone\fs18 This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL)&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ul\b This \f1 W\f0 orkbook examines the &apos;EUL&apos; definition and consists of the following \f1 W\f0 orksheets\ulnone ;&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0      \b Version\b0  - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Business Areas &amp; Folders\b0  - Folders, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Folders &amp; Items\b0  - Items, by Folder by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Joins\b0  - Joins defined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Conditions\b0  - Conditions defined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Hierarchies\b0  - Hierarchies defined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Item Classes \b0 - List of Values \f1 d\f0 efined, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Security \b0 - Access to Business Areas, by Users/Roles.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Privileges\b0  - Access Privileges, by Users/Roles.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Summary Mappings\b0  - Mapping of Folders to Summaries, by Business Area.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par     \b  Workbook Management\b0  - Who can access and run who&apos;s Workbooks.\ul\b &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ulnone\f2  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0\f0 You can use these \f1 W\f0 orkbooks to help document and administer your EUL.\ul\b\fs16 &#x000d;&#x000a;\par }&#x000d;&#x000a;" UniqueName="{5A751721-D200-11D5-B05B-00C04FEDB835}">
