<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="79" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Folders &amp; Items" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="True" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;A list of Folders and Items by Business Area&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;&apos;Item Dependency&apos; displays the Simple Folder and Item, that each Item depends upon.&#x000d;&#x000a;If the Item is a Calculation or an Admin Calculation then Item dependency displays all the Items used in the Calculation.&#x000d;&#x000a;To see the database column that each Item is based upon &apos;Drill&apos; on &apos;Item Dependency&apos; to &apos;Database Column&apos;." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="133" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;A list of Folders and Items by Business Area&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&apos;Item Dependency&apos; displays the Simple Folder and Item, that each Item depends upon.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;If the Item is a Calculation or an Admin Calculation then Item dependency displays all the Items used in the Calculation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;To see the database column that each Item is based upon &apos;Drill&apos; on &apos;Item Dependency&apos; to &apos;Database Column&apos;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f2\fswiss\fprq2 System;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qr\cf1\b\f0\fs18 &amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\qc\ul\i &amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\ulnone\i0 A list of Folders and Items by Business Area&#x000d;&#x000a;\par  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0 &apos;Item Dependency&apos; displays the \f1 S\f0 imple \f1 F\f0 older and \f1 I\f0 tem, that each \f1 I\f0 tem depends upon.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par If the Item is a \f1 C\f0 alculation or an Admin Calculation then Item dependency displays all the \f1 I\f0 tems used in the \f1 C\f0 alculation.\ul\b &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ulnone\b0 To see the database column that each \f1 I\f0 tem is based upon &apos;Drill&apos; on &apos;Item Dependency&apos; to &apos;Database Column&apos;.\b\f2\fs20 &#x000d;&#x000a;\par }&#x000d;&#x000a;" UniqueName="{5A751725-D200-11D5-B05B-00C04FEDB835}">
