<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="387" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Item Classes" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="True" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;Item Classes (Lists of Values) by Business Area&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;An Item Class is created on a single Folder and Item, this is shown here as the &apos;Primary Folder &amp; Item&apos;. &#x000d;&#x000a;It can then be used as a List of Values for other Folders and Items (Folders &amp; Item). &#x000d;&#x000a;The &apos;Alternate Sort&apos;  indicates the Folder Item used as the Sort sequence for a LOV." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="594" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;Item Classes (Lists of Values) by Business Area&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;An Item Class is created on a single Folder and Item, this is shown here as the &apos;Primary Folder &amp; Item&apos;. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;It can then be used as a List of Values for other Folders and Items (Folders &amp; Item). &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;The &apos;Alternate Sort&apos;  indicates the Folder Item used as the Sort sequence for a LOV.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f2\fswiss\fprq2 System;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qr\cf1\b\f0\fs18 &amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\qc\ul\i &amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\ulnone\i0 Item Classes (Lists of Values) by Business Area&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par An \f1 I\f0 tem Class is created on a single \f1 F\f0 older and \f1 I\f0 tem, this is shown here as the &apos;Primary Folder &amp; Item&apos;. &#x000d;&#x000a;\par It can then be used as a \f1 L\f0 ist \f1 o\f0 f \f1 V\f0 alues for other Folders and \f1 I\f0 tems (Folders &amp; Item). &#x000d;&#x000a;\par The &apos;Alternate Sort&apos;  indicates the Folder Item used as the \f1 S\f0 ort sequence for a LOV.\b\f2\fs20 &#x000d;&#x000a;\par }&#x000d;&#x000a;" UniqueName="{EC85D251-D2A1-11D5-B05C-00C04FEDB835}">
