<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="11" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Query Statistics " ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="False" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;Oracle Discoverer - &amp;Sheet&#x000d;&#x000a;This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL)&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;This Workbook examines the Query Statistics recorded in the EUL and consists of the following Worksheets;&#x000d;&#x000a;     Version - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Workbooks Queried by a User - What Workbooks has a User been running.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Workbook Query Statistics - What are the most popular Workbooks.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Workbooks that used Summaries  -Which Workbooks use which Summaries.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries by User - Who performs ad-hoc queries &amp; who uses the pre-defined Workbooks.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries by Workbook - Ad-hoc queries &amp; pre-defined Workbooks statistics.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries that used a Summary - Which of the ad-hoc &amp; pre-defined queries use Summaries." TitleAlign="Left" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="41" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;Oracle Discoverer - &amp;Sheet&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;This Workbook examines the Query Statistics recorded in the EUL and consists of the following Worksheets&lt;/u&gt;;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Version&lt;/b&gt; - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Workbooks Queried by a User&lt;/b&gt; - What Workbooks has a User been running.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Workbook Query Statistics&lt;/b&gt; - What are the most popular Workbooks.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Workbooks that used Summaries &lt;/b&gt; -Which Workbooks use which Summaries.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries by User &lt;/b&gt;- Who performs ad-hoc queries &amp; who uses the pre-defined Workbooks.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;     Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries by Workbook&lt;/b&gt; - Ad-hoc queries &amp; pre-defined Workbooks statistics.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries that used a Summary&lt;/b&gt; - Which of the ad-hoc &amp; pre-defined queries use Summaries.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f2\fswiss\fprq2 System;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qr\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs18 &amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\qc\i Oracle Discoverer - &amp;Sheet&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\ulnone\i0 This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL)&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ul\b This Workbook examines the \f1 Q\f0 uery \f1 S\f0 tatistics recorded in the EUL and consists of the following Worksheets\ulnone ;&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0      \b Version\b0  - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Workbooks Queried by a User\b0  - What \f1 W\f0 orkbooks has a \f1 U\f0 ser been running.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Workbook Query Statistics\b0  - What are the most popular Workbooks.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Workbooks that used Summaries \b0  -Which Workbooks use which Summaries.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      \b Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries by User \b0 - \fs20 Who performs ad-hoc queries &amp; who uses the pre-defined Workbooks.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b\fs18      Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries by Workbook\b0  - \fs20 Ad-hoc queries &amp; pre-defined Workbooks statistics.&#x