<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="8" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Workbooks Queried by User" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="True" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File) &#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;What are a &apos;Users&apos; most popular Workbooks &#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;Workbooks &amp; Worksheets that have been queried by a &apos;User&apos;, within a particular year &amp; month.  &apos;Query Type&apos; identifies those queries where the Workbook was run but not saved to the database (ad-hoc). The &apos;Worksheet Usage&apos; Item counts how  many &apos;user days&apos; during the month a Worksheet has been used for, this is a good indication of a Workbooks popularity with a User.  &#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;If no records are returned, then no query statistics have been recorded." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="74" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File) &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;What are a &apos;Users&apos; most popular Workbooks &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;Workbooks &amp; Worksheets that have been queried by a &apos;User&apos;, within a particular year &amp; month.  &apos;Query Type&apos; identifies those queries where the Workbook was run but not saved to the database (ad-hoc). The &apos;Worksheet Usage&apos; Item &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;counts how  many &apos;user days&apos; during the month a Worksheet has been used for, this is a good indication of a Workbooks popularity with a User. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;System&quot; color=#feffff&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;System&quot; color=#feffff&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;If no records are returned, then no query statistics have been recorded.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f2\fswiss\fprq2 System;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qr\cf1\b\f0\fs18 &amp;Date\ul\i &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\qc &amp;Sheet (&amp;File) &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ulnone\i0 What are a &apos;Users&apos; most popular Workbooks &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ul\i &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ulnone\b0\i0 Workbooks &amp; Worksheets that have been queried by a &apos;User&apos;, within a particular year &amp; month.  &apos;Query Type&apos; identifies those queries where the Workbook was run but not saved to the database (ad-hoc). The &apos;Worksheet Usage&apos; \f1 I\f0 tem counts how  many &apos;user days&apos; during the month a Worksheet has been used for, this is a good indication of a Workbooks popularity with a \f1 U\f0 ser. \f2  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b\f0 If no records are returned, then no query statistics have been recorded.\f2\fs20 &#x000d;&#x000a;\par }&#x000d;&#x000a;" UniqueName="{0DCA01BD-D756-11D5-B061-00C04FEDB835}">
