<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="249" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Workbook Query Statistics" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="True" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File) &#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;Find out which Workbooks &amp; Worksheets are the most popular&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;Workbooks &amp; Worksheets that have been queried by Users each month. &apos;Query Type&apos; identifies those queries where the Workbook was run but not saved to the database (Ad-hoc). The &apos;Worksheet Usage&apos; Item counts how &apos;User Days&apos; during the month a Worksheet has been used for. &#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;If no records are returned, then you have no query statistics recorded." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="406" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File) &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;Find out which Workbooks &amp; Worksheets are the most popular&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;Workbooks &amp; Worksheets that have been queried by Users each month. &apos;Query Type&apos; identifies those queries where the Workbook was run but not saved to the database (Ad-hoc). The &apos;Worksheet Usage&apos; Item counts how &apos;User &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;Days&apos; during the month a Worksheet has been used for. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;If no records are returned, then you have no query statistics recorded.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f2\fswiss\fprq2 System;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qr\cf1\b\f0\fs18 &amp;Date\ul\i &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\qc &amp;Sheet (&amp;File) &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ulnone\i0 Find out which Workbooks &amp; Worksheets are the most popular&#x000d;&#x000a;\par  \ul\i &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \ulnone\b0\i0 Workbooks &amp; Worksheets that have been queried by \f1 U\f0 sers each month. &apos;Query Type&apos; identifies those queries where the Workbook was run but not saved to the database (Ad-hoc). The &apos;Worksheet Usage&apos; \f1 I\f0 tem counts how &apos;\f1 U\f0 ser \f1 D\f0 ays&apos; during the month a Worksheet has been used for. \f2 &#x000d;&#x000a;\par &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b\f0 If no records are returned, then you have no query statistics recorded.\f2\fs20 &#x000d;&#x000a;\par }&#x000d;&#x000a;" UniqueName="{870E47FF-D81E-11D5-B062-00C04FEDB835}">
