<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="288" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Ad-hoc &amp; Pre-defined Queries by User" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="True" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;Who performs ad-hoc queries &amp; who uses the pre-defined Workbooks&#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;An ad-hoc queries is a Workbook that the User creates but does not save to the database. It is a Users one off query. &#x000d;&#x000a;To see &apos;Ad-hoc&apos; queries, ensure the &apos;Query Type&apos; in the Page items is set to &apos;Ad-hoc&apos;.&#x000d;&#x000a;Users ad-hoc queries are analysed by year, by month. &#x000d;&#x000a;To see what each User has been querying, on an ad-hoc basis, drill from the &apos;Usernames&apos; to the &apos;Folders Queried&apos; and then to the actual &apos;Items Queried&apos;.&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;If no records are returned, then you have no query statistics recorded." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="506" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;Who performs ad-hoc queries &amp; who uses the pre-defined Workbooks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;An ad-hoc queries is a Workbook that the User creates but does not save to the database. It is a Users one off query. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;To see &apos;Ad-hoc&apos; queries, ensure the &apos;Query Type&apos; in the Page items is set to &apos;Ad-hoc&apos;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;Users ad-hoc queries are analysed by year, by month. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;To see what each User has been querying, on an ad-hoc basis, drill from the &apos;Usernames&apos; to the &apos;Folders Queried&apos; and then to the actual &apos;Items Queried&apos;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;If no records are returned, then you have no query statistics recorded.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qr\cf1\b\f0\fs18 &amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\qc\ul\i &amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\ulnone\i0 Who performs ad-hoc queries &amp; who uses the pre-defined Workbooks&#x000d;&#x000a;\par &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0 An ad-hoc queries is a Workbook that the \f1 U\f0 ser creates but does not save to the database. It is a \f1 U\f0 sers one off query. &#x000d;&#x000a;\par To see &apos;Ad-hoc&apos; queries, ensure the &apos;Query Type&apos; in the Page items is set to &apos;Ad-hoc&apos;.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par Users ad-hoc queries are analy\f1 s\f0 ed by year, by month. &#x000d;&#x000a;\par To see what each \f1 U\f0 ser has been querying, on an ad-hoc basis, drill from the &apos;Usernames&apos; to the &apos;Folders Queried&apos; and then to the actual &apos;Items Queried&apos;.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b If no records are returned, then you have no query statistics recorded.\b0 &#x000d;&#x000a;\par }&#x000d;&#x000a;" UniqueName="{870E4803-D81E-11D5-B062-00C04FEDB835}">
