<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="211" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="End User Layer (EUL) - Version" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="False" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet&#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL).&#x000d;&#x000a; &#x000d;&#x000a;This workbook examines the  Workbooks saved to the EUL &amp; consists of the following Worksheets;&#x000d;&#x000a;     Version - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Workbook Access - Workbooks saved to the database and who can access them.&#x000d;&#x000a;    Workbook Dependency - Workbooks &amp; Worksheets - Items, Join, Conditions dependency.&#x000d;&#x000a;     If a Workbook or Worksheet fails to open, the following Folders can be used to examine the EUL for missing dependances:&#x000d;&#x000a;                Folders &amp; Items Lookup - Lookup Folders &amp; Items that currently exist in your.&#x000d;&#x000a;               Joins Lookup -Lookup Joins that currently exist in your EUL .&#x000d;&#x000a;               Conditions Lookup - Lookup Conditions that currently exist in your EUL." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="777" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;This is the current version of your &apos;End User Layer&apos; (EUL).&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;This workbook examines the  Workbooks saved to the EUL &amp; consists of the following Worksheets&lt;/u&gt;;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Version&lt;/b&gt; - The version of the Discoverer EUL you are currently using.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     &lt;b&gt;Workbook Access -&lt;/b&gt; Workbooks saved to the database and who can access them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;System&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workbook Dependency - &lt;/b&gt;Workbooks &amp; Worksheets - Items, Join, Conditions dependency.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     If a Workbook or Worksheet fails to open, the following Folders can be used to examine the EUL for missing dependances:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p alig