<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="3347" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Workbook Dependency - Folders &amp; Items Lookup" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="True" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;Lookup Folders &amp; Items that currently exist in your EUL&#x000d;&#x000a;Select Folder name or a Folder Developer Key to see if the item is visible in the Discoverer User Edition.&#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;Reasons why your Workbook or Worksheet may not be accessible:  &#x000d;&#x000a;     Dependant Item or Folder name and the item or Folder Developer Key name has changed.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Dependant Item or Folder is no longer visible (hidden) in the User Edition.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Dependant Item or Folder has been deleted from the EUL.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Dependant Item is no longer valid. No access to the database objects it is based upon." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="133" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lookup Folders &amp; Items that currently exist in your EUL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;Select Folder name or a Folder Developer Key to