<Sheet Background="" DeveloperKey="283" HasParamBitmap="True" Name="Workbook Dependency - Joins Lookup" ParamBitmap="" Showpageaxis="True" Title="&amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;Lookup Joins that currently exist in your EUL&#x000d;&#x000a;Joins are applied implicitly in Worksheets. This means that Joins are only exposed in the Discoverer Administration Edition.&#x000d;&#x000a;&#x000d;&#x000a;Reasons why your Workbook or Worksheet may not be accessible:  &#x000d;&#x000a;     Dependant Join removed.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Dependant Join  renamed and the Developer Key renamed.&#x000d;&#x000a;     Dependant Join is no longer valid. No access to the database objects it is based upon." TitleAlign="Tiled" TitleBackColor="32896" TitleBitmapReference="" TitleDeveloperKey="245" TitleHtml="&lt;table width=&quot;100%&quot; border=0 cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=right&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=center&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lookup Joins that currently exist in your EUL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;Joins are applied implicitly in Worksheets. This means that Joins are only exposed in the Discoverer Administration Edition.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;Reasons why your Workbook or Worksheet may not be accessible:  &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     Dependant Join removed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     Dependant Join  renamed and the Developer Key renamed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;System&quot; color=#feffff&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=#808000&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;p align=left&gt;&lt;font size=2 face=&quot;Arial&quot; color=#feffff&gt;     Dependant Join is no longer valid. No access to the database objects it is based upon.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;&lt;/table&gt;&#x000d;&#x000a;" TitleRtf="{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang2057{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Arial;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f2\fswiss\fprq2 System;}}&#x000d;&#x000a;{\colortbl ;\red254\green255\blue255;}&#x000d;&#x000a;\viewkind4\uc1\pard\qr\cf1\b\f0\fs18 &amp;Date&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\qc\ul\i &amp;Sheet (&amp;File)&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \pard\ulnone\i0 Lookup Joins that currently exist in your EUL&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \b0 Joins are applied implic\f1 i\f0 t\f1 l\f0 y in Worksheets. This means that Joins are only exposed in the Discoverer Administration Edition.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par &#x000d;&#x000a;\par Reasons why your Workbook or Worksheet may not be access\f1 i\f0 ble:  &#x000d;&#x000a;\par      Dependant Join removed.&#x000d;&#x000a;\par      Dependant Join  renamed and the Developer Key renamed\f2\fs20 .&#x000d;&#x000a;\par \f0\fs18      Dependant Join is no longer vali